openssl 3.5.9 (apache-2.0, see LICENSE.txt)

static libs for x86_64 mingw-w64, used by the http plugin for https on windows
built from the official source tarball (sha256 603f5602e2eef00d77fbd429d34dcd5822bb301757a1bc9cdb24c670f1eb859a) with

./Configure mingw64 --cross-compile-prefix=x86_64-w64-mingw32- no-shared no-tests no-apps no-docs no-module no-legacy no-engine
make build_libs && make install_dev
